msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Whoa, it's even more incredible than I was expectin'! Sure\r\n"
"are lots of teenagers in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it's pretty popular with the younger crowd. Anyway,\r\n"
"I think I'll wait out here. Don't buy any more than you're willing to carry, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "'Course not! Be back in a bit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Sorry to keep you waitin' out here, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "...Looks like you bought the entire store."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Heh, guess I got kinda carried away. But it was all so\r\n"
"cheap, I couldn't help it! Oh, and I nabbed some souvenirs\r\n"
"for the kids back at the orphanage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "You did? I really appreciate that, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Naw, it was nothin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Anyways. You think there's somewhere I can dump all this\r\n"
"stuff 'til we head home for the night? Maybe one of them\r\n"
"coin lockers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Oh, yeah. There are some lockers just down this street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Sweet, lead the way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2500"
msgid "Rikiya"
msgstr ""

